//? Title: Roulette-wheel selection: actual random thresholds and represented fitness shares
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Sample population indices according to nonnegative fitness weights while leaving
zero-weight indices unselected. Fitness-proportionate selection uses a native
uniform threshold and a strict-upper cumulative-weight search. Actual raw
stream, threshold and bucket records replace report-local counting. The original
weights 1,...,5 and 300,000 draws remain.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

For nonnegative weights f_i with positive total F, ideal selection probabilities
are p_i=f_i/F. The native implementation constructs a represented cumulative sum
and selects the first C_i strictly greater than an actual target uF.
$$ C_{i-1}\le uF<C_i. $$
\alttext(The selected bucket is the first cumulative weight strictly above the actual uniform target.)
Zero-width represented intervals cannot be selected. The stream uses the
historical xorshift13/7/17 recurrence and top53 bits for u in [0,1). This is a
deterministic pseudorandom experiment, not independent entropy. Model
construction is O(P), and actual binary-search draws cost O(N log P). Counts are
observed, not expected counts.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/roulette_wheel_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/roulette_wheel.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto t = a::roulette_wheel_trace({0, 2, 3}, 4, 1);
    std::print("| actual raw word | u | target | index | lower | upper | comparisons |\n| ---: | ---: | " "---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (const auto &v : t.draws)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", v.raw, v.uniform,
                   v.target, v.index, v.lower, v.upper, v.comparisons);
    const auto &first = t.draws[0];
    g::Diagram d;
    d.node("n0", {0, 0}, std::format("Actual uniform {:.6g}", first.uniform));
    d.node("n1", {5, 0}, std::format("Actual threshold {:.6g}", first.target));
    d.node("n2", {10, 0},
           std::format("Actual selected input id {}", first.index));
    d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    d.save_svg("build/roulette_wheel_tiny.svg");
}
